      "text": "I contacted this company for an estimate for aeration, reseeding, and a landscape project.  A representative came out the next day but did not really seem to know much about plants or flowers. Could not answer any of my questions.  Then they sent me an estimate for the project through text. A week later I agreed to part of the estimate so texted back I would like to get on the schedule.  I have not had a response from them at all.  I texted again to ask if I was on the schedule and no response.  Why come out to do an estimate and then not follow through with the actual job. Seems a tough way to keep a business going.",
